sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client (web or Android)
    participant A as Lumen API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    C->>A: POST /api/auth/login {email, password}
    A->>DB: find user by email
    A->>A: bcrypt.compare (dummy hash if unknown email)
    A->>DB: INSERT session (SHA-256 of refresh token)
    A-->>C: access JWT (15 min) + refresh token<br/>web: httpOnly cookie, mobile: body → SecureStore
    C->>A: GET /api/tasks (Authorization: Bearer JWT)
    A->>DB: session still active? (logout is immediate)
    A-->>C: 200 tasks owned by this user only
    Note over C,A: 15 minutes later
    C->>A: GET /api/tasks
    A-->>C: 401 TOKEN_EXPIRED
    C->>A: POST /api/auth/refresh (cookie or body)
    A->>DB: compare-and-swap token hash (rotation)
    A-->>C: new access JWT + new refresh token
    C->>A: retry GET /api/tasks
    Note over C,A: replaying an old refresh token revokes the session,<br/>and the app returns to sign-in with "Your session expired"
